     "order": 0,
     "text": "Ways to Save"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Start saving today with these simple tools:"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Keep the Change®"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "6",
     "href": "#disclosure-2027415311"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "We'll round up your debit card purchases to the nearest dollar amount, then transfer the difference from your eligible checking to the enrolled savings account."
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Automatic Transfers"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "Schedule recurring transfers from your checking to your savings account at the amount and frequency you choose."
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Split Direct Deposits"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "Automatically deposit a portion of your paycheck into savings."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "See an example of how you can add money to your savings when you use these features, check it out",
